		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=30018#p30018"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Concernant les paramètres ils sont les suivants :</p><br /><p>work_mem = &#039;16MB&#039;<br />maintenance_work_mem = &#039;128MB&#039;<br />min_wal_size = &#039;1GB&#039;<br />max_wal_size = &#039;2GB&#039;<br />checkpoint_timeout = &#039;10min&#039;<br />checkpoint_completion_target = &#039;0.9&#039;<br />effective_io_concurrency = &#039;20&#039;<br />wal_buffers = &#039;32MB&#039;<br />default_statistics_target = &#039;100&#039;<br />random_page_cost=&#039;1&#039;</p><br /><p>Merci</p>]]></content>
